    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": {
      "content": "The Electricity Maps API delivers real-time, historical, and forecasted electricity grid signals worldwide, including carbon intensity, power breakdown by source, renewable and carbon-free percentages, electricity flows, total and net load, and day-ahead pricing. Each signal is available in three temporality variants (latest, past, forecast) and can be queried by zone identifier, geographic coordinates, or data center provider/region.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Electricity Maps Support",
